      "title": "&f&lExplore with a purpose&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fChoose a destination for a useful discovery: crop, building palette, spell, equipment or workshop ingredient. Bring supplies, inventory space and a plan for returning home.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fRecord discoveries you cannot use yet; they may become useful in a later tier.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
